# Verifier /tmp cleanup command log — verify-20261015-v1 (2026-10-15)

Verification console record of the two bounded SSH commands run by the verifier
after its independent board probe re-run (stamp `verify-20261015-v1`).
Scope: exactly the four /tmp artifacts created by that re-run. No other files touched.

## Command 1 — list before cleanup (exit=0)

```
$ ls -l /tmp/railhmi_env_probe.py /tmp/railhmi_env_probe_board.md /tmp/railhmi_env_probe_board.raw.txt /tmp/railhmi_env_probe_board.json 2>&1
-rw-rw-r-- 1 admin admin 82314 Oct 15 21:17 /tmp/railhmi_env_probe_board.json
-rw-rw-r-- 1 admin admin 77205 Oct 15 21:17 /tmp/railhmi_env_probe_board.md
-rw-rw-r-- 1 admin admin 77205 Oct 15 21:17 /tmp/railhmi_env_probe_board.raw.txt
-rw-rw-r-- 1 admin admin 19686 Oct 15 21:17 /tmp/railhmi_env_probe.py
```

(Note: the listed mtimes 21:17 are the verifier's own re-run time; the re-run
had overwritten the implementation-run files of the same name, so the
implementation run's cleanup action at its own time could not be re-observed.)

## Command 2 — remove exactly those four files (exit=0)

